      "content": "For direct, evidence-based challenges, your reps should acknowledge the data while immediately contextualizing it. They can say, \"We are aware of the data regarding that specific event, and we prioritize proactive risk management in our use guidelines to minimize that risk in the real world.\" Then, they must immediately pivot back to your core value proposition, such as \"However, when we look at the comprehensive risk/benefit profile, the *unprecedented efficacy in achieving target goals* for this specific patient segment with CardioZen makes it the leading choice for those needing the most substantial benefit.\"",
